{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|mathematics}} For a [[complex number]], the [[principal square root]] of the [[sum]] of the [[square]]s of its [[real]] and [[imaginary]] parts. Denoted by | |.
#: The absolute value |x| of a real number x is x if x is non-negative, and -x if x is negative.

